{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14876","headline":"送朝长史赴荆南旧幕 · 卢纶","name":"送朝长史赴荆南旧幕","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"元瑜思旧幕，几夜梦旌旃。\n暑退蒹葭雨，秋生鼓角天。\n月明三峡路，浪里九江船。\n囗囗囗囗囗，囗囗囗囗囗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14876.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14876","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}